      hu: ["A legmagasabb csúcs, a Zubački kabao 1894 méteres.", "Itt találhatók Európa legmagasabb csapadékértékei (akár 5000 mm).", "A páncélfenyő legfontosabb montenegrói menedékhelye.", "Átlagon felüli számú helyi endemikus fajnak ad otthont.", "Tagolt karsztvidék rendkívül mély töbrökkel.", "Botanikai átmeneti zóna a Földközi-tenger és az Alpok között."],
      ro: ["Cel mai înalt vârf, Zubački kabao, atinge 1.894 de metri.", "Locul cu cele mai mari precipitații din Europa (până la 5.000 mm).", "Cel mai important refugiu pentru pinul Heldreich din Muntenegru.", "Găzduiește un număr peste medie de endemisme locale.", "Peisaj carstic fragmentat cu doline extrem de adânci.", "Zonă de tranziție botanică între Marea Mediterană și Alpi."],
      en: ["The highest peak, Zubački kabao, reaches 1,894 meters.", "Home to the highest rainfall in Europe (up to 5,000 mm annually).", "The most important refuge for Heldreich's pine in Montenegro.", "Hosts an above-average number of local endemic species.", "Rugged karst landscape featuring extremely deep sinkholes.", "Botanical transition zone between the Mediterranean and the Alps."],
